      "title": "Michael Jackson's 'Thriller' at 35: A Look Back at the Iconic Music Video By Those Who Made It",
      "url": "https://www.billboard.com/music/pop/michael-jacksons-thriller-35th-anniversary-interview-john-landis-john-branca-8487679",
