      "evidenceSummary": "브랭카 본인 인터뷰 원문 확인: 'when Michael felt pressure from the church, from Jehovah's Witnesses, he told me to get the film canisters and destroy them, before the Thriller video was ever released. So I held them in my office for many, many days and he would call everyday.' 루고시 이야기는 'I kinda made it up', 고지문은 'We'll put a disclaimer on it.' 12월 2일 MTV 첫 공개도 확인.",
      "usageNote": "WebFetch는 402였으나 브라우저 UA로 원문을 받아 직접 읽음."
    },
    {
      "title": "Why 'Thriller,' the Most Iconic Halloween Music Video Ever Made, Was Released in December",
      "url": "https://mentalfloss.com/article/89292/why-thriller-most-iconic-halloween-music-video-ever-made-was-released-december",
      "publisher": "Mental Floss (Kenneth Partridge)",
      "publishedAt": "2016-12-02T11:00:00Z",
      "retrievedAt": "2026-10-22T03:38:00+09:00",
      "kind": "article",
      "evidenceSummary": "1983년 12월 2일 공개, 약 14분, 공개 몇 주 전 잭슨이 브랭카에게 원본(negatives)을 없애 달라고 함(교단이 영상을 알고 제명 경고), 브랭카가 고지문을 제안했고 문구는 'Due to my strong personal convictions, I wish to stress that this film in no way endorses a belief in the occult.', 2009년 국립영화등기부 선정을 확인했습니다.",
      "usageNote": null
    },
    {
      "title": "How a Music Superlawyer Goaded Michael Jackson Into 'Thriller'",
